.SP p2
.L 47.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Once a skilled assassin for the Clan Cave Fox, Raine
.L 57.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]broke from the clan after discovering that a
.L 67.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]contract kill was, in fact, his own estranged father.
.L 77.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]Disgusted with himself, he abandoned that life —
.L 87.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]but the clan doesn't let members leave, and
.L 97.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]dispatched his old comrade Shou to hunt him
.L 107.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]down. Raine now wanders, trying to atone by
.L 117.69 38.70
\f[NSR]\s[8]helping those he can.
.L 367.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]Reserved and thoughtful, Raine speaks
.L 377.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]only when he has something worth
.L 387.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]saying, and his mind often wanders even
.L 397.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]when he's paying close attention — a
.L 407.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]habit that leads people to underestimate
.L 417.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]him. He practices swordsmanship and
.L 427.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]origami in his spare time, often folding
.L 437.69 217.40
\f[NSR]\s[8]paper to help himself think.
.CP
.SH
\&Raine: Attacks
.PP
\&Kaze Satsujinsha: Raine's skill with a sword is extraordinary. His legendary katana is a suitable companion.
.PP
\&Raging Thunder Slash: Raine whispers across his blade before striking with crackling electrical energy.
.PP
\&Electrical Storm: Raine summons the power of nature to cut swaths through legions of enemies.
.PP
\&Mist Touch: Raine concentrates his energies to project his very spirit into the opponent's mind.
.SH
\&Raine: Nightmares
.PP
\&Raine is plagued by nightmares of his violent past, especially his father's death, and rarely sleeps soundly — his sudden awakenings can startle anyone nearby.
.SH
\&Raine: Fluff
.PP
\&\f[NSB]Concept:\f[NSR] Ambiguously Sexed Sword Master, \f[NSB]Birthday:\f[NSR] January 31, \f[NSB]Age:\f[NSR] 23, \f[NSB]Gender:\f[NSR] Male, \f[NSB]Height:\f[NSR] 5'9", \f[NSB]Weight:\f[NSR] 140 lbs., \f[NSB]Hair:\f[NSR] Brown, \f[NSB]Eyes:\f[NSR] Brown, \f[NSB]Association:\f[NSR] Previously of Clan Cave Fox, \f[NSB]Hobbies:\f[NSR] Origami, \f[NSB]Favorite Food:\f[NSR] Miso Soup, \f[NSB]Allies:\f[NSR] None, \f[NSB]Enemies:\f[NSR] Shou, Clan Cave Fox.
